OL,3,APolice arrest teenager after shooting
OL,4,Athat injured 12, including children, in
OL,5,AFlorida
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice have arrested a teenager in
OL,8,Fconnection with a shooting on Saturday
OL,9,Fthat injured 12 people in Florida.
OL,11,FThe incident took place at 20:00 local
OL,12,Ftime (01:00 Sunday GMT), close to an
OL,13,FAmerican football stadium in the city
OL,14,Fof Tallahassee where a university game
OL,15,Fhad recently been played.
OL,17,FEleven people were injured by gunfire,
OL,18,Flocal police said, while another hurt
OL,19,Ftheir ankle while fleeing the scene.
OL,20,FSix of the victims were children.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
