OL,3,APolice arrest teenager after shooting
OL,4,Athat injured 12, including children, in
OL,5,AFlorida
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthony Rivers III, 15, has been
OL,8,Fcharged with 11 counts of attempted
OL,9,Fsecond-degree murder and possession of
OL,10,Fa firearm by a delinquent.
